Provider marks: one shared set for Morse Desktop and the Morse extension
(scripts/build.js copies this folder to dist/extension/brand/).

They are used only to name the service a person chooses (nominative use):
Claude Code, Codex, and an Anthropic or OpenAI API key. Morse is not made by,
affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic or OpenAI. The marks belong to their
owners. Each is the company's own artwork, unaltered except for size and a
transparent background; 96 x 96 PNG, shown at 48px or smaller (2x).

claude.png     The Claude mark (Anthropic PBC). Anthropic's own vector, from
               the favicon Anthropic publishes at https://platform.claude.com/
               (favicon.svg; the dark tile behind it removed). Anthropic's press
               kit, https://www.anthropic.com/press-kit, has the same mark.

anthropic.png  The Anthropic mark (Anthropic PBC), from Anthropic's own avatar
               on its GitHub organization, https://github.com/anthropics
               (white on dark there; here a black mark on transparent).

openai.png     The OpenAI mark (OpenAI), from OpenAI's own avatar on its GitHub
               organization, https://github.com/openai (black on white there;
               here black on transparent). Brand guidelines:
               https://openai.com/brand/

The black marks (anthropic.png, openai.png) are shown white in dark mode by a
CSS invert, the way both companies show them on dark backgrounds.
